      "order": 24,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Try on with FLUX.2 Klein 4B",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Try on with FLUX.2 Klein 4B\n\nTakes a photo of a person and a photo of clothes and edits the first photo so the person wears those clothes, with FLUX.2 Klein 4B and both photos as references. Built from Comfy's template image_flux2_klein_image_edit_4b_distilled.\n\n## Models\n\n- [flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors): FLUX.2 Klein 4B, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B).\n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors): Qwen3 4B text encoder, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B).\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-4B/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors): FLUX.2 VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-4B).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
  ],
